## 🧠 Core Concepts

### Beacon vs Session
| Mode | Description | When to Use |
|------|-------------|-------------|
| **Beacon** | Periodic check-ins (stealthy) | Default mode for persistence |
| **Session** | Real-time interactive connection | For interactive commands (e.g., `socks5`, `portfwd`) |

**Convert beacon to session:** `interactive`

### Staged vs Stageless
| Type | Description | File Size |
|------|-------------|-----------|
| **Staged** | Small stager downloads full payload | ~5-10 KB |
| **Stageless** | Full payload in one file | ~10-20 MB |

**Exam Recommendation:** Use staged payloads to keep initial footprint small.

