**Phase 3: Privilege Escalation (60-90 min)**
```text
1. Kerberoast (find SPN accounts)
2. AS-REP Roasting
3. Check ACL misconfigurations
4. Escalate to DA or SYSTEM
```

**Phase 4: Lateral Movement (60-90 min)**
```text
1. Identify other machines
2. Pivot using WMI/PsExec/WinRM
3. Get beacons on other machines
4. Collect additional flags
```

**Phase 5: Domain Dominance & Persistence (30-60 min)**
```text
1. Dump credentials (Mimikatz/Nanodump)
2. Golden/Silver Ticket
3. Set up persistence
4. Collect final flags
```

